<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Proposed single1390 trainer oracle: source precheck, not executed</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#101a29;color:#e7edf7;font:16px/1.8 "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}main{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:24px}a{color:#9fd5ff}nav{position:sticky;top:0;background:#172638;padding:12px;z-index:2;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}pre{overflow:auto;background:#09131f;padding:16px}code{font:13px/1.7 Consolas,monospace}table{border-collapse:collapse;display:block;overflow:auto}td,th{border:1px solid #45617e;padding:8px 12px}blockquote{border-left:4px solid #e7b667;margin:18px 0;padding:1px 16px;background:#203249}h1,h2,h3,h4{scroll-margin-top:85px}img{max-width:100%}.meta{font-size:12px;color:#a9bfd3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}summary{cursor:pointer}</style><nav><a href="../../../framework-architecture.html">主架构</a><a href="../../main-ui-map.html">逆向核心</a><a href="../index.html">关联文档目录</a><a data-source-download download href="../../../plugins/GRAY-MATCH-TRAINING-ORACLE-ABI-PRECHECK.md">下载原始文件</a></nav><main><details><summary>本页目录</summary><p style="margin-left:0px"><a href="#proposed-single1390-trainer-oracle-source-precheck-not-executed">Proposed single1390 trainer oracle: source precheck, not executed</a></p><p style="margin-left:14px"><a href="#exact-abi">Exact ABI</a></p><p style="margin-left:14px"><a href="#fixed-case-ranges-and-capacities">Fixed-case ranges and capacities</a></p><p style="margin-left:14px"><a href="#ownership-and-dependencies">Ownership and dependencies</a></p></details><h1 id="proposed-single1390-trainer-oracle-source-precheck-not-executed">Proposed single1390 trainer oracle: source precheck, not executed</h1><p>Target core SHA85D17ECC87D52E9A62D8BB86C8D5208AC999BCD31EC6D0806453F8165733F549, direct <code>befbb0→befdc0</code>. Root requires this ABI/address/ownership review before execution. Proposed input is one16x16 tight gray image with byte <code>(13*x+19*y+7)%181</code>, mask256 bytes all1, requested level1, angle start0/end0/step2, version1390, fixpoint(7.5f,7.5f). It is an isolated generator fixture, not a final matching score sample.</p>
<h2 id="exact-abi">Exact ABI</h2><p>Windows x64 first4 arguments: RCX=image pointer, EDX=image stride16, R8=mask pointer, R9D=mask stride16. <code>befbb0</code> prolog delta0xA8; following caller-entry stack argument offsets0x28..0x60 correspond to its current offsets0xD0..0x108. <code>befdc0</code> prolog delta0x4B8; corresponding offsets0x4E0..0x518.</p>
